  "result": "Perfect! All 149 tests pass. I've successfully added voucher support:\n\n**New error code in `src/errors.js`:**\n- `VOUCHER_EXISTS` \u2014 Invoice already has a voucher applied\n\n**Updated `invoiceTotals()` in `src/invoices.js`:**\n- Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- Includes voucher amount (defaults to 0 if no voucher)\n- Calculation: total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher\n- All amounts clamped to 0 minimum\n\n**New function `applyVoucher()` in `src/invoices.js`:**\n- Applies a fixed-amount voucher to a draft invoice\n- Validates:\n  - Status must be 'draft' (error NOT_DRAFT)\n  - No voucher already applied (error VOUCHER_EXISTS)\n  - Amount must be positive integer (error AMOUNT_INVALID)\n- Sets invoice.voucher = { code, amount }\n- Returns ok(newInvoice)\n- Never mutates the input invoice\n\n**Tests (9 voucher tests added):**\n- Adding voucher to draft invoice\n- Voucher reducing total correctly\n- Rejecting second voucher (VOUCHER_EXISTS)\n- Rejecting voucher on issued invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n- Amount validation (integer, positive, no negatives)\n- Non-mutation of input\n- Complex calculations with discount + VAT + voucher\n\nThe voucher system integrates seamlessly with existing discounts and VAT, allowing a fixed-amount discount to be applied after calculating the full invoice total with line discounts and VAT.",
